"page-layout theming" is a notebook page
	<header level="1">
		Page layout
		<header>A page layout puts what stays on screen around a page:  a menu across the top, a drawer of side navigation down the start, side bars either side of the page, and a footer.</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Set a public `--ui-*` token on the element, any ancestor or `:root`; it inherits into the shadow
			root. Edit a value below to try it.
		</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-page-layout" playground>
				<ui-page-layout style="min-height: 18em">
					<ui-app-menu slot="menu">
						<ui-site-nav-button slot="start" />
						<ui-site-breadcrumbs slot="start" />
						<ui-button slot="end" icon="bell" appearance="tertiary" size="small" title="Notices" />
					</>
					<ui-site-tabs slot="page-menu" />
					<ui-site-nav slot="drawer" appearance="nav" current="#api" pages="\[{ \"title\": \"Home\", \"href\": \"#home\", \"icon\": \"home\" }, { \"title\": \"Parts\", \"id\": \"group:Parts\", \"band\": \"group\", \"icon\": \"cubes\", \"pages\": \[{ \"title\": \"Button\", \"tab\": \"Usage\", \"href\": \"#usage\", \"pages\": \[{ \"title\": \"API\", \"href\": \"#api\" }, { \"title\": \"Theming\", \"href\": \"#theming\" }] }] }]" />
					<ui-text paragraph>The page goes here.  Going to another page redraws only this part.</>
					<ui-text slot="footer" color="grey">Made with Spell</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
